# This directory is bind-mounted as /home/node/.openclaw inside the openclaw
# container. Only the config template and skills are versioned; everything
# else is runtime state (sessions, agent auth, credentials, logs) and must
# stay out of git. The live openclaw.json is runtime state too — the gateway
# writes per-user agents/bindings into it — and is seeded from
# openclaw.json.example by the compose openclaw-init service.
*
!.gitignore
!openclaw.json.example
!skills/
!skills/**
!extensions/
!extensions/**
